<header class="page-header">
<div>
<p class="eyebrow">TOOLS / TEMPLATE EDITOR</p>
<h1>{{template.label}}</h1>
<p class="page-description">메시지를 작성하고 실제 전송과 같은 렌더러로 확인하세요.</p>
</div>
<div class="actions">
<a class="button secondary" href="/templates">목록으로</a>{{#unless template.isBuiltin}}<button id="template-save" form="template-form" type="submit" class="primary">{{> icon name="check"}}저장하기</button>{{/unless}}</div>
</header>
<section data-page="template-editor" data-template-id="{{template.id}}" data-readonly="{{template.isBuiltin}}">
  {{#if template.isBuiltin}}<div class="callout">기본 제공 템플릿은 읽기 전용입니다. 목록에서 복제한 뒤 편집하세요.</div>{{/if}}
  <div class="editor-layout">
<form id="template-form" class="panel editor-pane" hx-patch="/api/templates/{{template.id}}" hx-swap="none">
<div class="panel-header">
<h2>메시지 JSON</h2>
<span class="badge neutral">Handlebars</span>
</div>
<div class="editor-fields">
<label>표시 이름<input id="template-label" name="label" value="{{template.label}}" {{#if template.isBuiltin}}readonly{{/if}}>
</label>
<label for="template-body">템플릿 본문</label>
</div>
<textarea id="template-body" name="body" spellcheck="false" {{#if template.isBuiltin}}readonly{{/if}}>{{template.body}}</textarea>
<details class="variable-reference" open>
<summary>사용 가능한 변수</summary>
<div class="var-list">{{#each presetVars}}<button type="button" data-insert-var="{{name}}" title="{{description}}" {{#if ../template.isBuiltin}}disabled{{/if}}>
<code>{{name}}</code>
</button>{{/each}}</div>
<p class="muted">클릭하면 커서 위치에 JSON 문자열로 삽입됩니다.</p>
</details>
</form>
  <aside class="panel preview-pane">
<div class="panel-header">
<h2>Discord 미리보기</h2>
<span class="badge ok">PREVIEW</span>
</div>
<div class="preview-controls">
<fieldset class="segmented">
<legend class="sr-only">미리보기 모드</legend>
<label>
<input type="radio" name="previewMode" value="sample" checked>샘플 데이터</label>
<label>
<input type="radio" name="previewMode" value="live">실시간 피드</label>
</fieldset>
<label>미리보기 소스<select id="preview-source">
<option value="">기본 샘플 사용</option>{{#each sources}}<option value="{{id}}">{{name}}</option>{{/each}}</select>
</label>
<p class="muted">미리보기에는 번역을 적용하지 않으며 Discord로 전송하지 않습니다.</p>
</div>
<div id="preview" class="preview-box" aria-live="polite">
<p>미리보기를 불러오는 중…</p>
</div>
</aside>
</div>
</section>
